      "message": "changing --use-angle seems to change in ANGLE repo: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/angle/src/libANGLE/Display.cpp;l\u003d287;drc\u003d6bb1bc9bd1bb2cb578ef6dd72b6d8bb2e5792985\n\nThe idea is to add new flag \"gl-min-version\" and then we can set EGL_CONTEXT_OPENGL_BACKWARDS_COMPATIBLE_ANGLE and EGL_EXTENSIONS_ENABLED_ANGLE.\n\n(Looking at this code, there\u0027s no \"desktop\" or \"gles\" for --use-angle\u003d, we are just using the fallthrough default for these)",
