      "side": 1,
      "message": "Comment somewhere, perhaps here, about why we need to reinitialize rather than just initializing correctly the first time. (Because we can\u0027t check IsANGLE until after initializing once? Is it possible to determine that from whether Dawn is configured to use ANGLE, rather than by whether it\u0027s _actually_ ANGLE? For example on an Android device where the system driver is ANGLE, I\u0027m guessing we don\u0027t care if this toggle can be used.)",
      "revId": "58f5d6982c94f11e25191d11af4e528988e335f5",
